{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26250","headline":"送景玄上人还山 · 殷尧藩","name":"送景玄上人还山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩阳听罢讲经钟，远访庭闱锡度空。\n蒲履谩从归後织，衲衣犹记别时缝。\n地横龙朔连沙暝，山入乌桓碧树重。\n梵宇传来金贝叶，花前拜捧慰亲容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}